The Hashshashin Scenario
Difficulty : 4
Bonus : 40
--------------------------------------------------------------
Surrounded by enemies both real and potential, your best and most secret weapon is your troop of highly trained spies.
Infiltrate these agents into the heart of your foes and then bribe and assassinate your way to ultimate victory.
You must remove all neighboring Kingdoms from the world.  They have no right to take up space that could be better utilized by you.

